      "tag": "A",
      "text": "h1 · 64px\nBUILD PROMPT\nOVERALL AESTHETIC\nFONTS\nCOLOR THEME\nCOMPONENT CSS\nASSETS & MEDIA\nSECTIONS\nPASTE INTO YOUR AI APP\nClone promptFree\n\nOne prompt that rebuilds any site in Antigravity, Cursor or Claude Code, assets and all.\n\nGet a clone prompt",
      "href": "https://sitepeel.dev/free-tools/clone-prompt/",
      "type": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "A",
      "text": "h1 · 48px\nDESIGN.md\ncolors:\ntypography:\nAa\nGeist 650\n48 / 1.05\nrounded: 8px\nspacing: 4 8 16\nDESIGN.md generatorFree\n\nTurn any website into a DESIGN.md your AI coding agent can follow.\n\nGet a DESIGN.md",
      "href": "https://sitepeel.dev/design-md/",
      "type": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "A",
      "text": "gradient text\nSLOP SCORE\n72\n/100\nblob · blur 64px\nindigo-600 buttons\nicon cards × 3\nAI slop checkerFree\n\nA score for how AI-made a site looks, every tell we found and a prompt that fixes them.\n\nCheck a site",
      "href": "https://sitepeel.dev/free-tools/ai-slop-checker/",
      "type": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "A",
      "text": "glb · 3.7 MB\nhero.webp\n2400 × 1350\nlogo.svg\nSVG\nrobot.glb\n3D\nintro.lottie\nANIM\n312 FILES · 214 HIDDEN\nAsset extractorFree\n\nEvery image, SVG, video, 3D model and animation, hidden ones too.\n\nExtract assets",
      "href": "https://sitepeel.dev/free-tools/asset-extractor/",
      "type": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "A",
      "text": "CAP\nX-HEIGHT\nBASELINE\nAa\nGeist 650\nFONT\nGeist\nweight\n650\nsize\n48px\nline\n1.05\ntracking\n-0.05em\nGoogle Fonts ↗\nWhat font is this?Free\n\nEvery font a site uses, with weights, sizes and where to get it.\n\nFind fonts",
      "href": "https://sitepeel.dev/free-tools/font-finder/",
      "type": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "A",
      "text": "#C4A5ED\n#8AB4FF\n#8FD19E\n#F0C674\n#F59E7A\n--accent\n50–900\nColor paletteFree\n\nThe site’s real palette, ready for CSS, Tailwind or JSON.\n\nGet the palette",
      "href": "https://sitepeel.dev/free-tools/color-palette-generator/",
      "type": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "A",
      "text": "React\nUI\nGSAP\nANIMATION\nTailwind CSS\nCSS\nVercel\nHOSTING\nTech stackFree\n\nThe framework, hosting, libraries and tools behind any site.\n\nFind the stack",
      "href": "https://sitepeel.dev/free-tools/built-with/",
      "type": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "A",
      "text": "DESKTOP · 1440\nTABLET · 834\n390 × 844\nResponsive checkerFree\n\nSee a site on phones, tablets, laptops and monitors side by side, and what breaks.\n\nCheck every screen",
      "href": "https://sitepeel.dev/free-tools/responsive-checker/",
      "type": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "A",
      "text": "PNG\nJPG\nPDF\nWebsite screenshotFree\n\nFull-page screenshots of any site, framed, blurred where you need it and ready to share.\n\nTake a screenshot",
      "href": "https://sitepeel.dev/free-tools/screenshot/",
      "type": null
    },
