ON\nTailwind CSS\nCSS\nVercel\nHOSTING\nTech stackFree\n\nThe framework, hosting, libraries and tools behind any site.\n\nFind the stack\nDESKTOP · 1440\nTABLET · 834\n390 × 844\nResponsive checkerFree\n\nSee a site on phones, tablets, laptops and monitors side by side, and what breaks.\n\nCheck every screen\nPNG\nJPG\nPDF\nWebsite screenshotFree\n\nFull-page screenshots of any site, framed, blurred where you need it and ready to share.\n\nTake a screenshot\nAll free tools\nSitepeel\n\nFree website tools for designers and developers, and a Chrome extension with 13 more.\n\nFree tools\nDESIGN.md generator\nClone prompt\nAI slop checker\nAsset extractor\nResponsive checker\nWebsite screenshot\nAll free tools\nSitepeel\nChrome extension\nExtension tools\nPricing\nGuides\nAbout\nContact\nYour account\nLegal\nPrivacy\nTerms\nRefunds\nPrivacy choices\n\n© 2026 Sitepeel\n\nMade for people who build for the web\n\nOne quick check\nConfirm you’re human and we’ll start right away."
